---
layout: inner.njk
title: "Обекти — Ритеил парк Раковски"
description: "Разгледайте всички магазини и партньори в Ритеил парк Раковски."
---

<section class="relative bg-white/80 pt-28 sm:pt-32 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">

    {# ── Editorial header ── #}
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-px w-10 bg-brand-yellow"></span>
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] uppercase text-brand-yellow">Магазини &amp; Партньори</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.05]">
        Всичко на едно
        <span class="block italic font-light text-slate-900">
          <span class="underline decoration-brand-yellow decoration-[3px] underline-offset-[10px]">място</span>.
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Водещи марки, разнообразни услуги и удобен паркинг — открийте всички търговски обекти в Ритеил парк Раковски, събрани под един покрив.
      </p>
    </div>

    {# ── Partner cards grid ── #}
    <div class="mt-14 sm:mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for shop in shops.items %}
      <a
        href="{{ ('/obekti/' + shop.slug + '/') | url }}"
        class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/10 ring-1 ring-slate-200/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/15 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        {# Yellow top accent #}
        <span class="absolute left-8 top-0 h-px w-10 -translate-y-px bg-brand-yellow transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-24" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        {# Logo #}
        <div class="flex items-center min-h-[4.5rem] sm:min-h-[5rem]">
          {% if shop.logo %}
          <img
            src="{{ shop.logo | url }}"
            alt="{{ shop.title }}"
            class="max-h-12 max-w-[140px] w-auto object-contain object-left"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-teal">{{ shop.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold text-slate-500">{{ shop.category }}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 flex-1">{{ shop.description }}</p>

        <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-teal">
          Виж повече
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l5 5a1 1 0 010 1.414l-5 5a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L11.586 10 7.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
